WEBVTT

00:02:25.301 --> 00:02:31.622
anapata chini ya senti 15 kwa kila dola moja ya bidhaa unayonunua dukani.

00:02:32.877 --> 00:02:36.943
kwa pande mwingine, wakulima wanaouza 
mazao yao kwenye masoko ya wakulima

00:02:36.967 --> 00:02:39.716
wanapata karibia senti 90 kwa kila dolla 1

00:02:40.412 --> 00:02:42.995
lakini zaidi ya kuchukua kiasi kikubwa,

00:02:43.019 --> 00:02:45.543
wakulima wanatumia masoko haya kama fursa

00:02:45.567 --> 00:02:48.280
ya kujenga kizazi kijacho cha wakulima

00:02:48.304 --> 00:02:51.369
watakaolinda mashamba na wanyama wetu.

00:02:51.393 --> 00:02:55.415
katika kupambana na mabadiliko ya tabia nchi,


00:02:55.439 --> 00:02:58.262
kuhimiza na kudumisha matumizi
mbalimbali ya ardhi

00:02:58.960 --> 00:03:02.901
Pale mashamba ya vizazi kadhaa
yanapochukuliwa na makampuni makubwa ya kilimo,